WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.187 --> 00:00:04.687
(bright electronic music)

00:00:43.213 --> 00:00:47.329
- So close to the taste
and texture of real meat,

00:00:47.329 --> 00:00:49.005
versus normal plant-based burgers

00:00:49.005 --> 00:00:50.589
that it's freaking me out a little

00:00:50.589 --> 00:00:52.488
as someone who doesn't enjoy those things,

00:00:52.488 --> 00:00:54.437
which is actually a pretty big compliment.

00:00:54.437 --> 00:00:56.170
If you do enjoy that taste and texture,

00:00:56.170 --> 00:00:58.459
and you're looking to switch
to a more plant-based diet,

00:00:58.459 --> 00:01:01.959
this seems pretty close to the real thing.

00:01:03.576 --> 00:01:06.006
- I don't think I would think
twice if somebody gave this

00:01:06.006 --> 00:01:08.112
to me and told me it
was just a real burger

00:01:08.112 --> 00:01:10.754
without any qualifications.

00:01:10.754 --> 00:01:12.171
I'm a fan so far.

00:01:13.064 --> 00:01:16.564
(bright electronic music)

00:01:20.031 --> 00:01:22.281
(sizzling)

